[[Category:Creatures]]

Denmothers are larger, stronger [[Badger]]s that serve as mini-bosses in [[Badger Sett]]s. You will generally find one or two in the large rooms within them, with each dungeon usually containing at least one large room with at least one Denmother. They cannot be found in the wild.

Badgers are short-legged omnivores, distant relative to [[Otter]] and [[Wolverine]].

[[Badger Sett]]<nowiki/>s are mini-dungeons inhabited by Badgers and Denmothers.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

''Extremely'' aggressive in a certain radius to everyone, as all creatures have far higher aggression within dungeons. Being dungeon-dwellers only, they will never flee.

