===Strategy===
Denmothers are slightly stronger than Badgers, about on par with [[Wolverine]]s. Due to the cramped quarters of a dungeon, the only real strategy you should be using is an ordinary duel and/or kiting them, with no other tricks. If you need to use cliffs or ranged combat to kill them, you simply shouldn't be doing the dungeon yet.

